---- MODULE Upload ----
\* Generated by chart-to-tla.mjs from upload.mmd.
\* Each region is one variable and each transition label is one action.
\* Once you add guards and variables from the real code, this file is the source.
\* statechart.mjs from-chart upload.mmd keeps it, checks it, and compares it with the chart.

VARIABLES main
vars == <<main>>

\* Region Main
mainStates == {"Nothing chosen", "Upload failed", "Uploaded", "Uploading.Checking the file", "Uploading.Sending the file"}

TypeOK ==
    /\ main \in mainStates

Init ==
    /\ main = "Nothing chosen"

\* the last byte arrives
TheLastByteArrives ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Uploading.Sending the file" /\ main' = "Uploading.Checking the file")

\* the check passes
TheCheckPasses ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Uploading.Checking the file" /\ main' = "Uploaded")

\* you choose a file
YouChooseAFile ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Nothing chosen" /\ main' = "Uploading.Sending the file")

\* the network drops
TheNetworkDrops ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Uploading.Sending the file" /\ main' = "Upload failed")
       \/ (main = "Uploading.Checking the file" /\ main' = "Upload failed")

\* you retry
YouRetry ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Upload failed" /\ main' = "Uploading.Sending the file")

\* you cancel
YouCancel ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Uploading.Sending the file" /\ main' = "Nothing chosen")
       \/ (main = "Uploading.Checking the file" /\ main' = "Nothing chosen")

Next == TheLastByteArrives \/ TheCheckPasses \/ YouChooseAFile \/ TheNetworkDrops \/ YouRetry \/ YouCancel

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars

====
